# MASTER work principles

UI work reads at most:

1. Product Constitution
2. Decision Protocol
3. `app/spokedu-master/MASTER_VISUAL_SYSTEM.md`
4. Sprint Brief (when implementing)

Read Visual SSOT before changing MASTER UI. Same role = same grammar. Do not invent a new rule here. On conflict, follow Visual SSOT (product contracts still beat visual preference).

If a request collides with product semantics or Visual SSOT — say **conflict**. If both options fit — say **taste**.
